## 5. 核心数据模型

### 5.1 服务端内部状态

内部状态只存在于服务端内存与事件重放结果中，不直接同步给客户端。

```typescript
type GameState = {
  roomId: string;
  phase: Phase;
  players: Record<PlayerId, InternalPlayer>;
  seats: PlayerId[];
  ship: {
    x: number;
    y: number;
    heading: "east" | "west" | "north";
  };
  offices: {
    captainId?: PlayerId;
    firstMateId?: PlayerId;
    navigatorId?: PlayerId;
  };
  hands: {
    destinationDeck: DestinationCard[];
    captainHand: DestinationCard[];
    firstMateHand: DestinationCard[];
    navigatorChoice?: DestinationCard;
    discardPile: DestinationCard[];
  };
  roundNo: number;
  termRemaining: number;
  winner?: Faction;
};

type InternalPlayer = {
  id: PlayerId;
  nickname: string;
  connected: boolean;
  faction: Faction;
  role: Role;
  guns: number;
  muted: boolean;
  dead: boolean;
};
```

### 5.2 客户端视图

同一时刻，不同玩家收到的 `PlayerView` 可以不同。

```typescript
type PlayerView = {
  protocolVersion: number;
  roomId: string;
  viewerId: PlayerId;
  phase: Phase;
  me: VisibleSelf;
  players: VisiblePlayer[];
  ship: PublicShipState;
  offices: PublicOffices;
  publicLog: PublicLogEntry[];
  privatePrompt?: PrivatePrompt;
  hand?: VisibleHand;
  winner?: Faction;
};
```

### 5.3 协议消息

```typescript
const PROTOCOL_VERSION = 1;

type ClientActionEnvelope = {
  protocolVersion: number;
  actionId: string;
  roomId: string;
  playerId: PlayerId;
  action: ClientAction;
  sentAt: number;
};

type ServerMessage =
  | { type: "view.updated"; protocolVersion: number; view: PlayerView }
  | { type: "action.rejected"; protocolVersion: number; actionId: string; code: string; reason: string }
  | { type: "room.closed"; protocolVersion: number; reason: string };
```

协议规则：

- 协议版本不兼容时，服务端拒绝连接或动作，并提示客户端刷新。
- `actionId` 在单玩家单房间内幂等，重复提交不得重复生成事件。
- `ServerMessage` 不直接发送 `GameState`、`InternalPlayer`、牌堆、个人投票明细或他人私密手牌。
- 客户端不得根据本地规则推导权威状态，只能渲染最新 `PlayerView`。

### 5.4 事件日志

所有合法动作最终转成 `GameEvent`，追加到事件日志，再由 reducer 推导状态。

```typescript
type GameEvent =
  | { type: "player.joined"; seq: number; playerId: PlayerId; nickname: string; at: number }
  | { type: "session.reconnected"; seq: number; playerId: PlayerId; at: number }
  | { type: "game.started"; seq: number; seed: string; setup: SetupSnapshot; at: number }
  | { type: "captain.nominated"; seq: number; captainId: PlayerId; at: number }
  | { type: "officers.assigned"; seq: number; firstMateId: PlayerId; navigatorId: PlayerId; at: number }
  | { type: "vote.committed"; seq: number; playerId: PlayerId; guns: number; at: number }
  | { type: "vote.resolved"; seq: number; totalGuns: number; passed: boolean; at: number }
  | { type: "destination.drawn"; seq: number; cardIds: string[]; holderId: PlayerId; at: number }
  | { type: "destination.chosen"; seq: number; cardId: string; by: PlayerId; at: number }
  | { type: "ship.moved"; seq: number; cardId: string; to: { x: number; y: number }; at: number }
  | { type: "room.closed"; seq: number; reason: "ended" | "abandoned" | "timeout"; at: number }
  | { type: "game.ended"; seq: number; winner: Faction; reason: string; at: number };
```

事件规则：

- `GameEvent` 可以包含完整秘密，但只保存在服务端与数据库。
- `PublicLogEntry` 从 `GameEvent` 派生，不能泄露隐藏信息。
- MVP 不做复杂 CQRS 或多读模型，但必须保证单房间 `seq` 单调递增。
- 事件写入、内存 reduce、按玩家投射和广播顺序必须明确；失败时不得继续推进不可信状态。

