## 14. 部署

### 14.1 成本

| 项 | 方案 | 月成本 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 主机 | 阿里云轻量 上海 2C4G 4M BGP | ¥66 |
| CDN | 七牛云免费档或直接 Caddy 静态 | ¥0 |
| HTTPS | Caddy + Let's Encrypt | ¥0 |
| 域名 | `.fun` 等低价后缀 | 约 ¥5，按年付 |
| 监控 | 结构化日志 + 健康检查页 | ¥0 |
| 合计 | 首期不含域名约 ¥66 / 月 | 含域名折算约 ¥70–75 / 月 |

### 14.2 docker-compose

```yaml
version: "3.9"

services:
  game:
    build: ../packages/server
    restart: unless-stopped
    environment:
      NODE_ENV: production
      DATABASE_PATH: /data/kraken.sqlite
      LIVEKIT_HOST: http://livekit:7880
      LIVEKIT_KEY: ${LIVEKIT_KEY:-}
      LIVEKIT_SECRET: ${LIVEKIT_SECRET:-}
    volumes:
      - ./data:/data
    expose:
      - "2567"

  livekit:
    image: livekit/livekit-server:latest
    restart: unless-stopped
    command: --config /livekit.yaml
    volumes:
      - ./livekit.yaml:/livekit.yaml:ro
    ports:
      - "7880:7880"
      - "7881:7881"
      - "50000-50100:50000-50100/udp"
    profiles:
      - voice

  caddy:
    image: caddy:2-alpine
    restart: unless-stopped
    ports:
      - "80:80"
      - "443:443"
    volumes:
      - ./Caddyfile:/etc/caddy/Caddyfile:ro
      - ./client-dist:/srv/client:ro
      - caddy_data:/data
      - caddy_config:/config
    depends_on:
      - game

volumes:
  caddy_data:
  caddy_config:
```

### 14.3 Caddyfile

```caddyfile
kraken.example.fun {
  encode zstd gzip

  @ws {
    path /matchmake* /room*
  }
  reverse_proxy @ws game:2567

  @api {
    path /api/*
  }
  reverse_proxy @api game:2567

  @assets {
    path /assets/*
  }
  header @assets Cache-Control "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"

  root * /srv/client
  try_files {path} /index.html
  file_server
}

voice.kraken.example.fun {
  reverse_proxy livekit:7880
}
```

如果暂时不启用内置语音，可以先不配置 `voice.kraken.example.fun`，并用 `docker compose up -d` 启动核心游戏。

### 14.4 部署步骤

以下步骤用于 MVP 早期试跑。v1.0 前应逐步转向本地或 CI 构建前端静态产物与后端镜像，服务器只负责拉取产物、挂载 SQLite 数据卷和启动服务。

部署约束：

- Docker 镜像和 `deploy/client-dist` 不得包含 `assets-source/`。
- Caddy 只服务前端构建产物和 `packages/client/public/assets/` 中的优化后运行时资源。
- 原始模型、原始视频和未压缩大图不得上传到首版服务器。

```bash
ssh root@<host>
apt update
apt install -y docker.io docker-compose-plugin
sysctl -w net.ipv4.tcp_congestion_control=bbr

git clone <private-repo-url>
cd feed-the-kraken
pnpm install
pnpm --filter client build

mkdir -p deploy/client-dist
cp -r packages/client/dist/* deploy/client-dist/

cd deploy
cp .env.example .env
docker compose up -d
curl https://kraken.example.fun/api/health
```

